<title>USA: Lady Luck, Davis Gaming end partnership.</title>
<headline>Lady Luck, Davis Gaming end partnership.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lady Luck Gaming Corp and Davis Gaming said Tuesday they had dissolved a partnership formed in 1995 to develop a casino in Jefferson County, Missouri.</p>
<p>Lady Luck said it will continue to develop the Missouri project. A subsidiary of Lady Luck has the rights to the proposed casino site and owns the assets that would have been used for the partnership's project.</p>
<p>Davis Gaming, a private concern, said it will pursue the development and acquisition of gaming properties in other markets.</p>
</text>
